                                                "sense_id": "6ae14cc1-f468-39e5-889e-b33f985e7669",
                                                "text": "The sharp side of the circle of fifths can be read off directly from the white keys on a piano's octave (by making the appropriate jumps):\n Do–So–Re–La–Mi–Ti–Fi.\nAlso, the flat side of the circle of fifths can almost be read off entirely from the black keys on a piano's octave (with the exception of Fa):\n Do–Fa–Te–Me–Le–Ra–Se."
                                            }
